{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525940/extras/a100b8c1ce8351dc15e58c96da687b4a.poster.avif?t=1765126578\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525940/extras/a100b8c1ce8351dc15e58c96da687b4a.webm?t=1765126578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525940/extras/a100b8c1ce8351dc15e58c96da687b4a.mp4?t=1765126578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>&quot;I don't remember this place... but I know how it works.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pestilence</strong> is a first-person psychological horror story about the cost of vengeance. You play as a man who wakes up in a decaying industrial bunker with no memory of how he arrived. But as you navigate the rust and darkness, a terrifying realization takes hold: You didn't just stumble into this nightmare. You constructed it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TWO REALITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind is fractured between two worlds: the warm, deceptive memories of your family home, and the cold,  reality of your prison. Explore 90s-style environments to piece together the timeline of a tragedy. Is the voice on the radio helping you, or haunting you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESTORE THE MACHINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a walking simulator. You are here to work.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanical Puzzles:</strong> Repair generators, align pressure valves, and reroute power to unlock deeper levels of the facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigation:</strong> Find the tapes. Decipher the codes. The blueprint of this facility is hiding in your lost memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mannequins:</strong> They are silent. They are still. But they are watching.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CONFESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You brought four &quot;sinners&quot; here to make them confess. But in the darkness, the roles have changed. Are you the judge, or are you the prisoner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pestilence</strong> focuses on atmosphere, narrative, and tension rather than cheap jump scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive experience.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Telling.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D and 3D Scares.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles.</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525940?t=1765126578","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525940/45eb17e8065e91e839692a6785fdb167acf6adb0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765126578","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525940/2edea32032bfab1de611f566ce2e25f343d5eb62/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765126578","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525940/2edea32032bfab1de611f566ce2e25f343d5eb62/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765126578","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Depictions of Suicide, and Murder"},"demos":[{"appid":3579380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525940/extras/a100b8c1ce8351dc15e58c96da687b4a.poster.avif?t=1765126578\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525940/extras/a100b8c1ce8351dc15e58c96da687b4a.webm?t=1765126578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525940/extras/a100b8c1ce8351dc15e58c96da687b4a.mp4?t=1765126578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>&quot;I don't remember this place... but I know how it works.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pestilence</strong> is a first-person psychological horror story about the cost of vengeance. You play as a man who wakes up in a decaying industrial bunker with no memory of how he arrived. But as you navigate the rust and darkness, a terrifying realization takes hold: You didn't just stumble into this nightmare. You constructed it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TWO REALITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind is fractured between two worlds: the warm, deceptive memories of your family home, and the cold,  reality of your prison. Explore 90s-style environments to piece together the timeline of a tragedy. Is the voice on the radio helping you, or haunting you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESTORE THE MACHINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a walking simulator. You are here to work.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanical Puzzles:</strong> Repair generators, align pressure valves, and reroute power to unlock deeper levels of the facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigation:</strong> Find the tapes. Decipher the codes. The blueprint of this facility is hiding in your lost memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mannequins:</strong> They are silent. They are still. But they are watching.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CONFESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You brought four &quot;sinners&quot; here to make them confess. But in the darkness, the roles have changed. Are you the judge, or are you the prisoner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pestilence</strong> focuses on atmosphere, narrative, and tension rather than cheap jump scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive experience.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Telling.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D and 3D Scares.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles.</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Kooky Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525940/7171f9226f9f58e08f90a1b6ace9fc2a03d8ebbd/header.jpg?t=1765126578","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3525940/1872757550/8ef7c0135cac0ac4ba21ace43fbc36ca72900d3b/1765123866/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765124260","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3525940/1872757550/8ef7c0135cac0ac4ba21ace43fbc36ca72900d3b/1765123866/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765124260","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3525940/1872757550/8ef7c0135cac0ac4ba21ac